UI: {
	KrillPointPopup: +1 Krill Point!
	CombinesWithText: Combines With:
	2StarLocked: Must defeat a boss before obtaining 2 star Krills!
	3StarLocked: Must defeat Skeletron before obtaining 3 star Krills!
	4StarLocked: Must defeat a Mechanical Boss before obtaining 4 star Krills!
	5StarLocked: Must defeat Golem before obtaining 5 star Krills!
